OL,3,GNEWSAGirl 'millimetres from death' in
OL,4,Apolice shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest jury has heard a young girl
OL,7,Fwas millimetres from death when armed
OL,8,Fpolice officers shot and killed the man
OL,9,Fwho had been holding a knife to her
OL,10,Fneck.
OL,12,FSergii Kuzmenko was shot seven times by
OL,13,Ftwo Cumbria Police officers at a house
OL,14,Fon Borland Avenue in Carlisle on 19
OL,15,FDecember 2022.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
