OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGirl 'millimetres from death' in
OL,4,Apolice shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Office pathologist Dr Alison
OL,7,FArmour told the inquest at Workington
OL,8,Fthere were knife marks on the girl's
OL,9,Fneck and her injuries would have been
OL,10,F"unsurvivable" if more pressure had
OL,11,Fbeen applied, with the child
OL,12,Fpotentially dead within a minute.
OL,14,FReferring to photographs of the girl's
OL,15,Fneck, Armour told Cumbria Coroner's
OL,16,FCourt that vital blood vessels were
OL,17,Fjust millilitres away from the knife
OL,18,Fmarks.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
